# Model output is generated by tools/blender/build_assets.py.
# The shipped assets are committed; anything else stays out.
#
# driver.glb is on this list because it belongs on it: an asset the game
# expects has to be in the repo, or it is not an asset the game has. It
# was excluded once, which meant every build 404'd on it and two suites
# were permanently red over a file nobody could produce without Blender.
# build.json is the manifest — if you build the driver, commit both.
*.glb
!car-sedan.glb
!car-zx.glb
!car-gtr.glb
!car-rx7.glb
!wheel-5.glb
!wheel-6.glb
!palm.glb
!driver.glb
